66
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:58,433
He's going to have to be
behind them and take the hat.

67
00:02:58,500 --> 00:02:59,466
That'd be lovely.

68
00:02:59,533 --> 00:03:01,766
It's like he rolls out this carpet

69
00:03:01,833 --> 00:03:04,200
